      "message": "I find this to be a weird idiom. The more stuff you add, the more stuff you will need to explicitly reinitialize here that should not change during a device reset.\n\nWhat if the registers were in their own named structure inside of data, so you could just memset that? (Out of scope for this review, but the datasheet shows not all of the fields being 0 out of reset.)",
